      "revision": "campaign-r2-hybrid-full-v1-parent-review-pending",
      "instructions": "Print only supplied Traditional Chinese artwork text for Taiwan. Professional operational wording: explicit reconciliation objects, responsibility and practical next step. Use separately reviewed Taiwan terms; never convert mainland copy mechanically or assume national personality. No audit, vendor qualification or commercial guarantees. Keep original scene and narrative order. Preserve Traditional Chinese glyphs and exact supplied punctuation. Never mix scripts or use pseudo-Chinese. Use ASCII parentheses for approved acronym definitions to remain compatible with the frozen gate; do not normalize other punctuation. Review Taiwan punctuation placement, Chinese line starts/ends and mixed Latin terms at 333px; reduce scene area before shrinking type. B13v5 bright white/blue photographic campaign family. Reference wording is not approved copy. Official supplied logo once; no extra DIGIWIN header. Exact category/sequence near logo. Body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Source normal full-width main paragraph on white, at least body-sized. All paper blank; no bars/rules/charts/ticks/data glyphs/UI/customer geography/seal/badge. Only approved artwork words. Demand-change questions are not forecast accuracy or automatic replanning claims. Reduce scene before type. TARGETED BODY TYPOGRAPHY REPAIR ONLY. Actual edit target is reference1. Preserve exact approved headline, category, counter, brand and blue-white scene family. Body currently too small on one line. Enlarge body Chinese glyph height to approximately56px or larger on1254canvas and wrap into2or3 lines; never compress to one line. Exact complete body: 先釐清需求變化涉及哪些委外批次，再與生產合作夥伴討論計畫。 Rebalance/reduce lower illustration only to make room. No added/deleted words, no simplification of Traditional glyphs, no data/values/UI/extra decorations. Preserve1/6, wafer carrier and neutral blank report props. Full headline 需求預測變了，哪些批次相關？ Keep readable margins and whole text."
    }
